Hello,

 

I just like to inform you that I am going to present the Bluetooth SBC codec
at the next IETF conference. I will also talk about BlueZ open source
implementation and its Ekiga plugin.

 

With best regards,

 Christian

 

 

 

From: avt-bounces@ietf.org [mailto:avt-bounces@ietf.org] On Behalf Of Roni
Even
Sent: Tuesday, November 04, 2008 6:58 PM
To: avt@ietf.org
Cc: 'Tom Taylor'
Subject: [AVT] Draft agenda for Minneapolis

 

Hi,

I prepared a draft agenda and will submit it tomorrow afternoon

See if you have comments

Roni Even

 

 

Audio/Video Transport (AVT) Working Group

=========================================

 

CHAIRS:  Tom Taylor        <tom.taylor@rogers.com>

         Roni Even         <ron.even.tlv@gmail.com>

 

AGENDA

 

Monday, 17 November 2008 at 15:20-17:20 (Salon AB)

--------------------------------------------------

15:20   Introduction and Status Update                      (Chairs, 15)

 

15:35   RTP Payload Format for SVC Video                   (Schierl, 15)

        draft-ietf-avt-rtp-svc-15

 

15:50   RTP Payload Format for H.264 Video                  (Ye-Kui, 10)

        draft-ietf-avt-rtp-rfc3984bis-01 

 

16:00   Multi-Session and Multi-source transmission        (Schierl, 10)

        draft-schierl-avt-rtp-multi-session-transmission-00

 

16:10   Rapid Synchronisation of RTP Flows                    (Even, 10)

        draft-perkins-avt-rapid-rtp-sync-00

 

16:20   Rapid Synchronization with RTP Multicast Sessions(Ver Steeg, 15)

        draft-versteeg-avt-rapid-synchronization-for-rtp-01

 

16:35   RTCP Feedback Mechanism for Burst Streaming          (Levin, 15)

        draft-levin-avt-rtcp-burst-00

 

16:50   RTP Payload Format for Bluetooth's SBC audio codec   (Hoene, 10)

        draft-hoene-avt-rtp-sbc-00

 

17:00   End

 

 

 

Tuesday, 18 November 2008 at 17:10-18:10 (Salon AB)

---------------------------------------------------

17:10   RTCP XR                                             (Clarck, 20)

        draft-ietf-avt-rtcp-xr-*

 

17:30   RTP Payload format for Application and Desktop Sharing(Boyaci, 20)

        draft-boyaci-avt-app-sharing-00

 

17:50   SRTP Store and Forward                                (Blom, 10)

        draft-mattsson-srtp-store-and-forward-01

 

18:00   End


